        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 4.9. No terms can be added to this Contract nor any provision thereof changed by arbitration. With respect to the interpretation or application of any provisions of this Agreement the decision of the arbitrators shall be final and binding upon the parties. Notwithstanding anything to the contrary contained in this Agreement, the following matters shall be excluded from arbitration except as to interpretation.",
